#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:351
msgctxt "Route116_Text_ScoundrelMadeOffWithPeeko"
msgid ""
"Ohhh, what am I to do?\p"
"We were on our walk, PEEKO and I, when\n"
"we were jumped by an odd thug…\p"
"The scoundrel made off with my\n"
"darling PEEKO!\p"
"Wrrrooooooaaaar! PEEKO!$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀，我该怎么办才好？\p"
"我和皮可正在散步，\n"
"突然被一个奇怪的坏蛋袭击了……\p"
"那个恶棍把我亲爱的皮可抢走了！\p"
"呜哇啊啊啊啊！皮可！$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:359
msgctxt "Route116_Text_WantToDigTunnel"
msgid ""
"Nnn… Roar!\p"
"I want to dig that tunnel!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……吼！\p"
"我想挖那条隧道！$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:363
msgctxt "Route116_Text_DiggingTunnelWhenGoonOrderedMeOut"
msgid ""
"Nnn… Roar!\n"
"What's going on?\p"
"I was digging the tunnel without any\n"
"tools when some goon ordered me out!\p"
"That tunnel's filled with POKéMON\n"
"that react badly to loud noises.\l"
"They could cause an uproar.\p"
"That's why we stopped using heavy\n"
"equipment for tunneling…\p"
"I'm worried that the goon will do\n"
"something stupid and startle the\l"
"POKéMON into an uproar.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……吼！到底怎么回事？\p"
"我正在不用任何工具挖隧道的时候，\n"
"有个坏蛋把我赶了出来！\p"
"那条隧道里有很多对巨大声响很敏感的\n"
"宝可梦。它们可能会闹得天翻地覆。\p"
"所以我们才不再用重型\n"
"机械来挖隧道了……\p"
"我很担心那个坏蛋会做出什么蠢事，\n"
"惊动宝可梦，引发大骚乱。$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:377
msgctxt "Route116_Text_GoonHightailedItOutOfTunnel"
msgid ""
"Nnn… Roar!\p"
"That goofy goon hightailed it out of\n"
"the tunnel! I can go back to digging!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……吼！\p"
"那个傻乎乎的坏蛋从隧道里逃走了！\n"
"我可以回去继续挖了！$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "Route116_Text_ThankYouTokenOfAppreciation"
msgid ""
"Oh! It's you!\p"
"You're that person who not only helped\n"
"me in PETALBURG WOODS, but also got\l"
"back my stolen package and then even\l"
"graciously delivered it to SLATEPORT!\p"
"CAPT. STERN informed us that the\n"
"package arrived, too!\p"
"I thank you very, very much!\p"
"Why, if I were a rain cloud, I would\n"
"shower you with gratitude and hail\l"
"you as a hero!\p"
"For you, the most wonderful TRAINER,\n"
"I bear good news!\p"
"Recently, our company developed\n"
"a new kind of POKé BALL.\p"
"As a token of our appreciation, this\n"
"is our gift to our wonderful TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"哦！是你啊！\p"
"你就是在橙华森林帮过我，\n"
"还帮我找回被偷的包裹，\l"
"甚至好心地送到凯那市的那个人吧！\p"
"楠木船长也通知我们包裹已经送到了！\p"
"真是太、太感谢你了！\p"
"哎呀，如果我是一朵雨云，\n"
"我一定要把感激之情像雨一样洒在\l"
"你身上，把你当成英雄来欢呼！\p"
"我要给你这位最棒的\n"
"训练家带来一个好消息！\p"
"最近，我们公司开发出了\n"
"一种新型的精灵球。\p"
"为了表示我们的谢意，\n"
"这是送给最棒的训练家的礼物！$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:401
msgctxt "Route116_Text_NewBallAvailableAtMart"
msgid ""
"Our new POKé BALL will be available\n"
"at the POKéMON MART in RUSTBORO.\p"
"Please do try it out!\n"
"Thank you and bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"我们的新型精灵球会在\n"
"卡那兹市的友好商店发售。\p"
"请一定要试试看！谢谢你，再见啦！$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:407
msgctxt "Route116_Text_BagIsJamPacked"
msgid ""
"Your BAG is jam-packed.\n"
"I can't give you this REPEAT BALL.$"
msgstr ""
"你的包包已经塞满了。\n"
"没办法把重复球给你。$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:411
msgctxt "Route116_Text_TokenOfAppreciation"
msgid ""
"As a token of our appreciation for\n"
"your delivering our package, I have\l"
"a gift of a new kind of POKé BALL\l"
"for our most wonderful TRAINER!$"
msgstr ""
"为了感谢你帮我们送包裹，我要把\n"
"一种新型的精灵球送给最棒的训练家！$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "Route116_Text_CanYouHelpMeFindGlasses"
msgid ""
"I dropped my glasses…\n"
"Can you help me find them?$"
msgstr "我的眼镜掉了……你能帮我找找吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "Route116_Text_MayISeeThoseGlasses"
msgid ""
"Those glasses!\n"
"May I see them for a second?$"
msgstr "那副眼镜！可以借我看一下吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:425
msgctxt "Route116_Text_NotWhatImLookingForMaybeTheyArentHere"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"These are BLACKGLASSES.\l"
"They're not what I'm looking for…\p"
"Maybe my glasses aren't around\n"
"here…$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……这是黑色眼镜。\n"
"不是我要找的那副……\p"
"也许我的眼镜不在这附近……$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:432
msgctxt "Route116_Text_CantFindGlassesNotHere"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"I can't find my glasses anywhere…\l"
"Maybe they're not around here…$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……我到处都找不到我的眼镜……\n"
"也许不在这附近吧……$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:437
msgctxt "Route116_Text_NotWhatImLookingFor"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"These are BLACKGLASSES.\l"
"They're not what I'm looking for…$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……这是黑色眼镜。\n"
"不是我要找的那副……$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:442
msgctxt "Route116_Text_RouteSignRustboro"
msgid ""
"ROUTE 116\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} RUSTBORO CITY$"
msgstr ""
"116号道路\n"
"{LEFT_ARROW} 卡那兹市$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:446
msgctxt "Route116_Text_RusturfTunnelSign"
msgid ""
"RUSTURF TUNNEL\n"
"“Linking RUSTBORO and VERDANTURF\p"
"“The tunnel project has been\n"
"canceled.”$"
msgstr ""
"卡绿隧道\n"
"“连接卡那兹市和绿荫镇\p"
"“隧道工程已经中止。”$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:452
msgctxt "Route116_Text_TunnelersRestHouse"
msgid "TUNNELER'S REST HOUSE$"
msgstr "隧道工人休息处$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:455
msgctxt "Route116_Text_TrainerTipsBToStopEvolution"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"If you want to stop a POKéMON from\n"
"evolving, press the B Button while it\l"
"is trying to evolve.\l"
"The startled POKéMON will stop.\p"
"This is called an evolution cancel.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"如果不想让宝可梦进化，\n"
"就在它要进化的时候按B键。\l"
"受到惊吓的宝可梦就会停止进化。\p"
"这叫做取消进化。$"

#: data/maps/Route116/scripts.inc:463
msgctxt "Route116_Text_TrainerTipsBagHasPockets"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"Your BAG has several POCKETS.\p"
"Items you obtain are automatically\n"
"placed in the appropriate POCKETS.\p"
"No TRAINER can afford to be without\n"
"a BAG of their own.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"包包里有好几个口袋。\p"
"得到的道具会自动放进对应的口袋里。\p"
"每位训练家都必须要有一个自己的包包。$"
